{"seq":1,"slug":"nutrition-science","title":"营养科学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.52,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 营养科学基础\n\n## 概述\n\n营养科学（Nutrition Science）是研究食物与人体健康之间关系的学科，涵盖从分子层面的营养素代谢到宏观层面的饮食模式分析。本 hub 从自学者角度出发，系统梳理营养科学的核心知识体系。\n\n## 学习目标\n\n- 理解三大宏量营养素（碳水化合物、蛋白质、脂质）的生物化学基础与代谢路径\n- 掌握微量营养素（维生素、矿物质）的功能与缺乏/过量的生理影响\n- 认识人体能量代谢系统的运作机制与激素调控网络\n- 能够评估循证饮食模式，理解精准营养（Precision Nutrition）的前沿方向\n- 具备阅读和批判性分析营养学研究文献的基本能力\n\n## 章节结构\n\n| 章节   | 主题           | 核心内容                                         |\n| ------ | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 第一章 | 三大宏量营养素 | 碳水化合物与血糖反应、蛋白质生物学、脂质代谢     |\n| 第二章 | 微量营养素     | 水溶性维生素、脂溶性维生素与矿物质、肠道微生物组 |\n| 第三章 | 代谢与能量系统 | 细胞能量代谢、代谢灵活性、激素调控               |\n| 第四章 | 饮食模式与实践 | 循证饮食模式、精准营养、文献阅读方法             |\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 高中水平的生物学和化学基础\n- 对人体基本生理功能有初步认识\n\n## 关键背景\n\n2026 年 JACC 大规模队列研究（Harvard，20 万成人，30 年随访）确认：**食物质量优先于宏量营养素比例计算**。健康型低碳水（植物蛋白 + 不饱和脂肪）与健康型低脂（全谷物 + 水果）饮食均降低冠心病风险，而不健康版本则增加风险。这一发现深刻影响了现代营养学的研究范式——从单一营养素还原论转向食物整体模式分析。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"macronutrients","title":"三大宏量营养素","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/macronutrients","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"carbohydrates-and-glycemic-response","title":"碳水化合物与血糖反应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/macronutrients/carbohydrates-and-glycemic-response"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protein-biology-and-requirements","title":"蛋白质生物学与需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/macronutrients/protein-biology-and-requirements"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lipids-and-fatty-acid-metabolism","title":"脂质与脂肪酸代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/macronutrients/lipids-and-fatty-acid-metabolism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"micronutrients","title":"微量营养素","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/micronutrients","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"water-soluble-vitamins","title":"水溶性维生素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/micronutrients/water-soluble-vitamins"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fat-soluble-vitamins-and-minerals","title":"脂溶性维生素与矿物质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/micronutrients/fat-soluble-vitamins-and-minerals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gut-microbiome-and-nutrient-absorption","title":"肠道微生物组与营养吸收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/micronutrients/gut-microbiome-and-nutrient-absorption"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"metabolism-energy","title":"代谢与能量系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/metabolism-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cellular-energy-metabolism","title":"细胞能量代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/metabolism-energy/cellular-energy-metabolism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metabolic-flexibility-and-adaptation","title":"代谢灵活性与适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/metabolism-energy/metabolic-flexibility-and-adaptation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hormonal-regulation-of-metabolism","title":"激素对代谢的调控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/metabolism-energy/hormonal-regulation-of-metabolism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"dietary-patterns","title":"饮食模式与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evidence-based-dietary-patterns","title":"循证饮食模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns/evidence-based-dietary-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"precision-nutrition-and-nutrigenomics","title":"精准营养与营养基因组学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns/precision-nutrition-and-nutrigenomics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reading-nutrition-research","title":"如何读懂营养学研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns/reading-nutrition-research"}]}]}